<title>UK: Capital Industries to buy Swiss label firm.</title>
<headline>Capital Industries to buy Swiss label firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Packaging group Capital Industries Plc said on Wednesday it had agreed to buy Panoval, a Swiss-based manufacturer of laminated paper products for labelling and other packaging applications, for approximately 9.1 million stg.</p>
<p>It said approximately 8.0 million stg of the acquisition would be funded by the issue of 4.55 million new ordinary shares. The remaining balance would be funded out of existing cash reserves, Capital said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
